      "refersTo": "button-preset",
      "description": "The primary action: jump to the rooftop count where noon solar equals noon demand.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-preset\"><span class=\"ds-preset-action\">Jump to noon match</span><span class=\"ds-preset-detail\">263 rooftops: solar = demand at noon</span></button>",
